peyton_original/** -diff -merge

# Binary artifacts must never be EOL-converted (BUNDLE-CRLF-001 / the v3 git-archive CRLF
# incident: with core.autocrlf=true and no attributes, a fresh checkout or archive could rewrite
# LF->CRLF inside PDFs and corrupt them; the finalize script worked around it with
# -c core.autocrlf=false — these attributes remove the hazard at the source).
*.pdf    -text
*.png    -text
*.jpg    -text
*.jpeg   -text
*.zip    -text
*.xlsx   -text
*.pkl    -text
*.bundle -text
*.ico    -text
*.woff   -text
*.woff2  -text
